# Files the GitNexus indexer should not read.
#
# Binary assets have no symbols to extract, and reading them as text crashes
# the analyzer outright ("Failed calling LOWER: Invalid UTF-8" when
# electron/build/icon.png was added), which fails the gitnexus-index
# pre-commit hook for everyone.
*.png
*.ico
*.icns
*.gif
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.otf
*.7z
*.zip
*.AppImage
*.dmg
*.exe
